    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>US Military: Operation 'Bath House'</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Skibidi has escaped. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a soldier sent down into the Skibidi's lair, to retrieve 10 viable samples of the Toilet water this creature inhabits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligence shows that water is its source of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every molecule of the Skibidi exudes radiation, which leaks into the water it lives in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARPA scientists have found a way to synthesize this water into a poison, lethal to its kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, once you enter the Skibidi's lair, you may never leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the procedurally-generated anomalies, go through the right doors, and you just might reach Room 10 alive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skibidi Toilet: Operation Terror is a short psychological horror game, set in an endless maze of bathroom stalls, which can only be escaped through observing each stall carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Exit 8, a truly wonderful game, ST:OT is my first horror game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-20 minutes per playthrough. Infinite variations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>US Military: Operation 'Bath House'</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Skibidi has escaped. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a soldier sent down into the Skibidi's lair, to retrieve 10 viable samples of the Toilet water this creature inhabits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligence shows that water is its source of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every molecule of the Skibidi exudes radiation, which leaks into the water it lives in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARPA scientists have found a way to synthesize this water into a poison, lethal to its kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, once you enter the Skibidi's lair, you may never leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the procedurally-generated anomalies, go through the right doors, and you just might reach Room 10 alive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skibidi Toilet: Operation Terror is a short psychological horror game, set in an endless maze of bathroom stalls, which can only be escaped through observing each stall carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Exit 8, a truly wonderful game, ST:OT is my first horror game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-20 minutes per playthrough. Infinite variations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "The Skibidi has escaped. Your mission: retrieve 10 vials of Toilet water for DARPA to synthesize into a poison against it. Carefully observe each stall to escape the Endless Bathrooms, avoid the Skibidi, and reach 'Room 10'",
